==Route to the final==
As the winners of the [[2024–25 UEFA Champions League]], [[Paris Saint-Germain FC|Paris Saint-Germain]] qualified directly for the final of the tournament. [[CR Flamengo|Flamengo]] advanced as the winners of the play-off match, known as the FIFA Challenger Cup, played on 13 December 2025.

