==Match==
===Summary===
In the 38th minute, [[Khvicha Kvaratskhelia]] scored when he finished at the back post from close range after a low cross from the right by [[Désiré Doué]] which Flamengo goalkeeper [[Agustín Rossi (footballer)|Agustín Rossi]] got a hand to but couldn't prevent it reaching Kvaratskhelia. In the 62nd minute, Flamengo were awarded a penalty when [[Giorgian de Arrascaeta]] was fouled by [[Marquinhos]], [[Jorginho (footballer, born December 1991)|Jorginho]] scored with a low finish to the right. The match went to extra-time and eventually a penalty shoot-out. PSG goalkeeper [[Matvey Safonov]] saved four penalties in a row as PSG won the match 2-1 on penalties.<ref>{{cite web|url= https://www.bbc.com/sport/football/live/c17xzryxyllt|title=Paris St-Germain 1 Flamengo 1 (2-1 on pens)|date=17 December 2025|work=BBC Sport|accessdate=13 August 2026}}</ref>

